{"row_index": 11, "id": "-THoVjtIkeU$_$12", "video_id": "-THoVjtIkeU", "clip_id": "12", "text": "What ever we turn our attention to is what grows and so if we believe that anything is possible, if we believe that social justice can be achieved and if we believe in youth, they will believe in themselves.", "label": 2.0, "annotation": "Positive", "source": "-THoVjtIkeU/12.mp4", "source_sha256": "e2f148f4f2e74724dc13b3ce870a0ce6a06740cfc224f5a9b3d0a870b196e7d4", "status": "complete", "metadata": "samples/-THoVjtIkeU$_$12/metadata.json", "features": "samples/-THoVjtIkeU$_$12/features.npz"}
{"row_index": 12, "id": "-THoVjtIkeU$_$2", "video_id": "-THoVjtIkeU", "clip_id": "2", "text": "I think social justice is extremely important for young people.", "label": 1.3333333730697632, "annotation": "Positive", "source": "-THoVjtIkeU/2.mp4", "source_sha256": "35a6c2464ffd68dd96411edb5dc2763f0efb59f264c1d8b737e616fa6b0d1d5b", "status": "complete", "metadata": "samples/-THoVjtIkeU$_$2/metadata.json", "features": "samples/-THoVjtIkeU$_$2/features.npz"}
{"row_index": 13, "id": "-THoVjtIkeU$_$6", "video_id": "-THoVjtIkeU", "clip_id": "6", "text": "You know that I think listening to young people, taking in what they have to say because what we have seen all around the world is the power of youth.", "label": 2.6666667461395264, "annotation": "Positive", "source": "-THoVjtIkeU/6.mp4", "source_sha256": "efaa55ee6394032c867046690a92c29edfd825005f0a090cca5ccb763b227f64", "status": "complete", "metadata": "samples/-THoVjtIkeU$_$6/metadata.json", "features": "samples/-THoVjtIkeU$_$6/features.npz"}
{"row_index": 14, "id": "-UuX1xuaiiE$_$1", "video_id": "-UuX1xuaiiE", "clip_id": "1", "text": "^And all of them are really being able to explore ^these different areas in depth ^in a way that really wasn't available ^before the center was here", "label": 1.6666666269302368, "annotation": "Positive", "source": "-UuX1xuaiiE/1.mp4", "source_sha256": "d5bbda38fcec15817d2b87bab5dcc559d6d425f7d28a82e6c32d13f14b48650c", "status": "complete", "metadata": "samples/-UuX1xuaiiE$_$1/metadata.json", "features": "samples/-UuX1xuaiiE$_$1/features.npz"}
