{"row_index": 20, "id": "-aqamKhZ1Ec$_$0", "video_id": "-aqamKhZ1Ec", "clip_id": "0", "text": "In 2008, there were very serious tribal warfare in Kenya following a disputed election.", "label": -2.0, "annotation": "Negative", "source": "-aqamKhZ1Ec/0.mp4", "source_sha256": "6f6e674bbba4353399e9e7825217f37e6d8ca1adf9675f33cf37106f31c55548", "status": "complete", "metadata": "samples/-aqamKhZ1Ec$_$0/metadata.json", "features": "samples/-aqamKhZ1Ec$_$0/features.npz"}
{"row_index": 21, "id": "-dxfTGcXJoc$_$1", "video_id": "-dxfTGcXJoc", "clip_id": "1", "text": "For the 10th straight year, some of Kentucky’s best and most innovative biotech companies and technologies were on display at the annual BIO International Convention, which I and other state officials attended this week in Chicago.", "label": 1.6666666269302368, "annotation": "Positive", "source": "-dxfTGcXJoc/1.mp4", "source_sha256": "b5ffdc98a4a98b8f0aae55dee5fed66a43bcb129f47a250a004c1cc74e572595", "status": "complete", "metadata": "samples/-dxfTGcXJoc$_$1/metadata.json", "features": "samples/-dxfTGcXJoc$_$1/features.npz"}
{"row_index": 22, "id": "-dxfTGcXJoc$_$0", "video_id": "-dxfTGcXJoc", "clip_id": "0", "text": "This is Governor Steve Beshear ... About Kentucky Our state is home to more than 1,500 bioscience and lifescience companies and more than 100,000 people who work for these firms, in areas from nutrigenomics and pharmaceuticals to nanotechnology and medical devices.", "label": 1.0, "annotation": "Positive", "source": "-dxfTGcXJoc/0.mp4", "source_sha256": "04bd0be907fb46c613f926fe1b06bc2c3b30881c293156510baa34a4105ade55", "status": "complete", "metadata": "samples/-dxfTGcXJoc$_$0/metadata.json", "features": "samples/-dxfTGcXJoc$_$0/features.npz"}
{"row_index": 23, "id": "-dxfTGcXJoc$_$2", "video_id": "-dxfTGcXJoc", "clip_id": "2", "text": "An estimated 20,000 biotech scientists, executives and industry experts from more than 50 nations were at the BIO conference to learn about the latest scientific advances, and to exchange ideas and establish business relationships.", "label": 0.6666666865348816, "annotation": "Positive", "source": "-dxfTGcXJoc/2.mp4", "source_sha256": "46a5e523b5dd00364c99a3bcbc6fae4c80e1382a84b5b5e681c46eb074ed10f7", "status": "complete", "metadata": "samples/-dxfTGcXJoc$_$2/metadata.json", "features": "samples/-dxfTGcXJoc$_$2/features.npz"}
{"row_index": 24, "id": "-dxfTGcXJoc$_$6", "video_id": "-dxfTGcXJoc", "clip_id": "6", "text": "Kentucky’s participation at the annual BIO International Convention is the primary means by which our high-tech companies and institutions can reach out to the global scientific community.", "label": 0.6666666865348816, "annotation": "Positive", "source": "-dxfTGcXJoc/6.mp4", "source_sha256": "55c1ff86729ab21da743a5107ed07b220e41b4193cd1c0ba9f009e65c3ab0513", "status": "complete", "metadata": "samples/-dxfTGcXJoc$_$6/metadata.json", "features": "samples/-dxfTGcXJoc$_$6/features.npz"}
{"row_index": 25, "id": "-egA8-b7-3M$_$26", "video_id": "-egA8-b7-3M", "clip_id": "26", "text": "We're updating it all the time and looking forward to your comments on our videos.", "label": 1.6666666269302368, "annotation": "Positive", "source": "-egA8-b7-3M/26.mp4", "source_sha256": "11f78aed680ea9c5862a15e04ff6c1f8776c46d29c98b68d28773ff39d959685", "status": "complete", "metadata": "samples/-egA8-b7-3M$_$26/metadata.json", "features": "samples/-egA8-b7-3M$_$26/features.npz"}
{"row_index": 26, "id": "-egA8-b7-3M$_$17", "video_id": "-egA8-b7-3M", "clip_id": "17", "text": "As you have more experience, you have more times exhibiting, you get to know more people.", "label": 0.3333333432674408, "annotation": "Positive", "source": "-egA8-b7-3M/17.mp4", "source_sha256": "f967e81e0edd51c3700671721afb3fbecbbc32652f27d2db40ea444e8d80c68f", "status": "complete", "metadata": "samples/-egA8-b7-3M$_$17/metadata.json", "features": "samples/-egA8-b7-3M$_$17/features.npz"}
{"row_index": 27, "id": "-egA8-b7-3M$_$18", "video_id": "-egA8-b7-3M", "clip_id": "18", "text": "It becomes easier at each one of these conferences to connect with people that you've met or that you're doing business with.", "label": 1.0, "annotation": "Positive", "source": "-egA8-b7-3M/18.mp4", "source_sha256": "fd4bc95a6adfb16a9588b7ed65cc2812186ce3d607804dc76f4486312951ef90", "status": "complete", "metadata": "samples/-egA8-b7-3M$_$18/metadata.json", "features": "samples/-egA8-b7-3M$_$18/features.npz"}
{"row_index": 28, "id": "-egA8-b7-3M$_$16", "video_id": "-egA8-b7-3M", "clip_id": "16", "text": "Third, another big benefit of exhibiting is connecting with existing clients.", "label": 0.6666666865348816, "annotation": "Positive", "source": "-egA8-b7-3M/16.mp4", "source_sha256": "4c015f85e3bd901ecedde8c0c2ca4a756d9a77dfe4177625c481581f2037ff9c", "status": "complete", "metadata": "samples/-egA8-b7-3M$_$16/metadata.json", "features": "samples/-egA8-b7-3M$_$16/features.npz"}
{"row_index": 29, "id": "-egA8-b7-3M$_$13", "video_id": "-egA8-b7-3M", "clip_id": "13", "text": "What are you doing that's different?\" They always want an answer.", "label": 0.3333333432674408, "annotation": "Positive", "source": "-egA8-b7-3M/13.mp4", "source_sha256": "cbd627c225ebca37521ae238cb9ec254cad236822f4f37ebfbb039e6c56aea4c", "status": "complete", "metadata": "samples/-egA8-b7-3M$_$13/metadata.json", "features": "samples/-egA8-b7-3M$_$13/features.npz"}
{"row_index": 30, "id": "-egA8-b7-3M$_$1", "video_id": "-egA8-b7-3M", "clip_id": "1", "text": "I started a successful Legal Nurse Consulting Business in 1989. I mentor nurses who want to become Legal Nurse Consultants.", "label": 0.6666666865348816, "annotation": "Positive", "source": "-egA8-b7-3M/1.mp4", "source_sha256": "589a7989b1b4888568c31614a2d6beefba88fb87289c85b94df2d8051500403b", "status": "complete", "metadata": "samples/-egA8-b7-3M$_$1/metadata.json", "features": "samples/-egA8-b7-3M$_$1/features.npz"}
{"row_index": 31, "id": "-egA8-b7-3M$_$6", "video_id": "-egA8-b7-3M", "clip_id": "6", "text": "First exhibiting is a wonderful opportunity to network with other legal vendors.", "label": 0.6666666865348816, "annotation": "Positive", "source": "-egA8-b7-3M/6.mp4", "source_sha256": "2e88a00d5e55863aa956b4b0949fc0e4f2975ccfd83b3194957f6fca86ecfce0", "status": "complete", "metadata": "samples/-egA8-b7-3M$_$6/metadata.json", "features": "samples/-egA8-b7-3M$_$6/features.npz"}
{"row_index": 32, "id": "-egA8-b7-3M$_$9", "video_id": "-egA8-b7-3M", "clip_id": "9", "text": "Secondly, another goal of exhibiting  is building your company image.", "label": 0.3333333432674408, "annotation": "Positive", "source": "-egA8-b7-3M/9.mp4", "source_sha256": "bcd643f328616312eae9b28e6c9aabbe8acaec3e4c4be58daeb45e3eee4d973c", "status": "complete", "metadata": "samples/-egA8-b7-3M$_$9/metadata.json", "features": "samples/-egA8-b7-3M$_$9/features.npz"}
{"row_index": 33, "id": "-egA8-b7-3M$_$20", "video_id": "-egA8-b7-3M", "clip_id": "20", "text": "Now you've got a face that you can connect with a voice, and that makes you closer to that client.", "label": 0.3333333432674408, "annotation": "Positive", "source": "-egA8-b7-3M/20.mp4", "source_sha256": "719ef133920e74b3ea33925d2bca0270b062199116867568f88ac83cadcd74e8", "status": "complete", "metadata": "samples/-egA8-b7-3M$_$20/metadata.json", "features": "samples/-egA8-b7-3M$_$20/features.npz"}
{"row_index": 34, "id": "-iRBcNs9oI8$_$3", "video_id": "-iRBcNs9oI8", "clip_id": "3", "text": "Well, it is the secret of power pose", "label": 0.6666666865348816, "annotation": "Positive", "source": "-iRBcNs9oI8/3.mp4", "source_sha256": "39c547acd1a8da2ebc6c6ab008191a5676420398a974cd9611cad087f0ccec50", "status": "complete", "metadata": "samples/-iRBcNs9oI8$_$3/metadata.json", "features": "samples/-iRBcNs9oI8$_$3/features.npz"}
{"row_index": 35, "id": "-iRBcNs9oI8$_$7", "video_id": "-iRBcNs9oI8", "clip_id": "7", "text": "Well, for starters, let's look at the word \"power\"", "label": 0.6666666865348816, "annotation": "Positive", "source": "-iRBcNs9oI8/7.mp4", "source_sha256": "cc7b1c7a06ec41d72007b5c42fb8036f30b66d5cf76e3f093160c22fc5e38081", "status": "complete", "metadata": "samples/-iRBcNs9oI8$_$7/metadata.json", "features": "samples/-iRBcNs9oI8$_$7/features.npz"}
{"row_index": 36, "id": "-iRBcNs9oI8$_$6", "video_id": "-iRBcNs9oI8", "clip_id": "6", "text": "What is a power pose", "label": 0.3333333432674408, "annotation": "Positive", "source": "-iRBcNs9oI8/6.mp4", "source_sha256": "030b0b8d8d4ae47799432ab71b66fcc881f077c5b0feef892c1f146dc0a592e3", "status": "complete", "metadata": "samples/-iRBcNs9oI8$_$6/metadata.json", "features": "samples/-iRBcNs9oI8$_$6/features.npz"}
{"row_index": 37, "id": "-iRBcNs9oI8$_$9", "video_id": "-iRBcNs9oI8", "clip_id": "9", "text": "Power is similar to strength", "label": 1.3333333730697632, "annotation": "Positive", "source": "-iRBcNs9oI8/9.mp4", "source_sha256": "352bdcc73d3622d6abac1b09f2039b211d15b9bf7acee66f0b07783c9b7a4c74", "status": "complete", "metadata": "samples/-iRBcNs9oI8$_$9/metadata.json", "features": "samples/-iRBcNs9oI8$_$9/features.npz"}
